From 8a46291b283249fe2e6db3f553caf5a6dea2a694 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:47:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] mm: hbf: add observability for range hint lifecycle
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add tracepoints covering every stage of the hint lifecycle:
  hbf_hint_submit, hbf_hint_validate, hbf_hint_reject, hbf_hint_queue,
  hbf_hint_start, hbf_page_move, hbf_hint_complete, hbf_hint_cancel,
  hbf_demand_touch, hbf_deadline_miss, hbf_queue_full

Add debugfs interface at /sys/kernel/debug/hbf/ with:
  stats     — cumulative counters
  backends  — registered backend list
  reset_stats — write 1 to clear counters

Signed-off-by: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
